events from anyone who can reach it, so the destination","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"builds on every platform. Without a token, Matomo takes no event tracked more than a day","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before it arrives, so the encoder leaves out a record tracked more than 23 hours before it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is encoded (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoEncodingError\/timestampOutsideWindow"},{"text":"). A request is encoded once and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retried as it is, so one still undelivered 23 hours after its oldest record was tracked, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the time ","type":"text"},{"code":"now","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gives, isn’t sent again: it is dropped and reported as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDropReport.deadlineExceeded(deadline:recordIDs:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", rather than reach Matomo too late to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be stored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoSetupError\/invalidURL"},{"text":" for a URL that isn’t ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https"},{"text":", has no host name,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has a user name or password, a query or fragment, or a path ending in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".php"},{"text":" file, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any case; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoSetupError\/invalidSiteID"},{"text":" for a site ID below 1;","type":"text"},{"text":"